    "identifier": "psionics-strike",
    "description": "<p>You coat the hands and feet of a creature you touch in psionic energy. Making each strike harm both the body and mind simultaneously.</p>\n<p>When they would deal damage with an unarmed attack, they deal an additional 1d10 psychic damage, once per turn. If they would score a critical hit while gaining the benefits of this jutsu, you can choose to convert all damage dealt with the attack into psychic damage.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the damage by 1d10.</p>",
